EditPad Classic v3.5.3 [ASP] - EditPad Classic
is a small but powerful text editor and
Notepad replacement. It is compact (a single
exe) and has an easy-to-use tabbed interface.
Some of its features include:  * EditPad can
open as many files at a time as you want, with
no arbitrary file size limit.  * ANSI <=> OEM
(DOS ASCII) conversion.  * System tray icon
(optional)  * Opens and saves Unix and Mac
files  * Costs only one postcard!
